# A box's width and height typed fast over the canvas, before the field has
# the keyboard: the width 0.4, its second part on the frame the field takes
# the keyboard and Enter on the next; then the height 25cm, its letters
# included, and Enter on the frame after its seed, which places the corner.
open docs/instances/sketch-basic.json
wait 16
action tool.box
wait 2
click L 708 339
move 789 291 3
wait 2
text "0"
wait 1
text ".4"
key Enter
wait 4
text "25cm"
key Enter
wait 4
